OL,3,A'Dragon' offers street artist advice -
OL,4,Aand a job
OL,5,
OL,6,FA street artist who appeared on the BBC
OL,7,FDragons' Den came away with an offer of
OL,8,Fboth professional advice - and a job.
OL,10,FNathan Murdoch, 38, runs Street Arts
OL,11,FHire and has painted several murals in
OL,12,FPeterborough, including tributes to
OL,13,FProdigy singer Keith Flint, and a Jude
OL,14,FBellingham portrait during the football
OL,15,FWorld Cup.
OL,17,FHe said he went on the show looking for
OL,18,Ffurther investment in his arts
OL,19,Fbusiness, but all the Dragons agreed
OL,20,Finstead that he needed sound advice in
OL,21,Forder to expand.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,170,160,200,105,0,100
