OL,3,A'Dragon' offers street artist advice -
OL,4,Aand a job
OL,5,
OL,6,FEntrepreneur Steven Bartlett was so
OL,7,Ftaken with Murdoch's work he offered
OL,8,Fthe artist both one-to-one advice and a
OL,9,Fjob painting the walls of his new
OL,10,FLondon offices.
